# Battle against Regieleki (the electron golem): the Regis' tapped code (short, short, long) on a pulse, bare
# parallel fifths, and a frantic F-sharp-minor square lead over a breakbeat. Original composition for this game.
title Battle! Regieleki
tempo 200
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.06
reverb 0.2

